Hi {{first_name}},

An account has been set up for you on the {{provider_name}} apprenticeship system. You can use it to log your off-the-job hours, add portfolio evidence, see your progress reviews and message your tutor.

  Username: {{username}}
  Temporary password: {{password}}

Please sign in and change your password straight away (Account security > Change password). Nobody from {{provider_name}} will ever ask you for it.

If you weren't expecting this email, reply and let us know.

{{provider_name}}
